#: ../../learn/index.rst:2
msgid "Get started"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:4
msgid "Zett Agent runs one loop: send messages to a model, run the tools it asks for, and repeat until it answers. These pages take you from a zero-key example to a real provider with streaming, tools, and persistent sessions."
msgstr "Zett Agent 只运行一个循环：向模型发送消息，执行它请求的工具，如此重复，直到模型给出答案。这些页面会带你从一个无需密钥的示例，走到接入真实模型提供商、并使用流式输出、工具和持久会话的完整用法。"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:9
msgid "Build your first conversation"
msgstr "构建你的第一个对话"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:11
msgid "**Suggested path:** :doc:`installation` → :doc:`first-agent` → :doc:`providers` → :doc:`tools` → :doc:`streaming` → :doc:`sessions`."
msgstr "**建议路径：** :doc:`installation` → :doc:`first-agent` → :doc:`providers` → :doc:`tools` → :doc:`streaming` → :doc:`sessions`\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:17
msgid "Install"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:21
msgid "Install from PyPI, or run every example from a checkout."
msgstr "从 PyPI 安装，也可以直接在源码检出目录里运行所有示例。"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:23
msgid "Your first agent"
msgstr "你的第一个智能体"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:27
msgid "Run two turns without an API key and see what keeps the history."
msgstr "无需 API 密钥即可运行两个轮次，并看清是什么在保留历史记录。"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:29
msgid "Connect a provider"
msgstr "连接模型提供商"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:33
msgid "Point the loop at OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, DeepSeek, or Ollama."
msgstr "让循环对接 OpenAI、Anthropic、Google、DeepSeek 或 Ollama。"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:35
msgid "Define tools"
msgstr "定义工具"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:39
msgid "Turn a typed Python function into a model-callable tool."
msgstr "把带类型注解的 Python 函数变成模型可调用的工具。"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:41
msgid "Stream to a UI"
msgstr "流式输出到界面"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:45
msgid "Show partial text, reasoning, tool calls, and results as they happen."
msgstr "实时展示部分文本、推理、工具调用和工具结果。"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:47
msgid "Keep conversations"
msgstr "保存对话"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:51
msgid "Restore history across requests, processes, and restarts."
msgstr "跨请求、跨进程、跨重启恢复历史记录。"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:54
msgid "Add the capabilities you need"
msgstr "按需添加所需能力"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:56
msgid "These features are optional. Choose them for your task rather than enabling every extension from the start."
msgstr "这些功能都是可选的。请根据任务来选择，而不是一开始就启用所有扩展。"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:66
msgid "Load AGENTS.md guidance with an explicit workspace scope."
msgstr "以明确的工作区范围加载 AGENTS.md 指引。"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:68
msgid "Image inputs"
msgstr "图像输入"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:72
msgid "Send text and images to a vision-capable model with typed content parts."
msgstr "用带类型的内容部分，把文本和图像发送给支持视觉的模型。"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:74
msgid "MCP tools"
msgstr "MCP 工具"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:78
msgid "Connect trusted HTTP or stdio servers and manage their tool lifecycle."
msgstr "连接受信任的 HTTP 或 stdio 服务器，并管理其工具生命周期。"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:80
msgid "Capabilities on demand"
msgstr "按需加载能力"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:84
msgid "Load skill instructions as needed and search deferred tools on supported endpoints."
msgstr "按需加载技能指令，并在支持的端点上搜索延迟加载的工具。"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:86
msgid "JIT Python tools"
msgstr "JIT Python 工具"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:90
msgid "Let a trusted model compose, evolve, and save a toolbox for reuse."
msgstr "让受信任的模型编写、演进并保存一个可复用的工具箱。"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:93
msgid "Build an application"
msgstr "构建应用"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:95
msgid "For a service, follow :doc:`configuration` → :doc:`application` → :doc:`testing`. Blocking scripts can start with :doc:`synchronous`."
msgstr "如果要做服务，请按 :doc:`configuration` → :doc:`application` → :doc:`testing` 的顺序阅读；阻塞式脚本可以从 :doc:`synchronous` 开始。"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:101
msgid "Configure your agent"
msgstr "配置你的智能体"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:105
msgid "Choose defaults, override one request, and compose extensions safely."
msgstr "选定默认值，覆盖单个请求，并安全地组合扩展。"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:107
msgid "Synchronous calls"
msgstr "同步调用"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:111
msgid "Use the same runtime from ordinary blocking code and scripts."
msgstr "在普通的阻塞式代码和脚本中使用同一个运行时。"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:113
msgid "Integrate an application"
msgstr "集成到应用"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:117
msgid "Handle deadlines, concurrent sessions, disconnects, and shutdown."
msgstr "处理期限、并发会话、连接断开和关闭流程。"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:119
msgid "Test your agent"
msgstr "测试你的智能体"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:123
msgid "Check tools and real provider adapters without network access."
msgstr "在没有网络访问的情况下检查工具和真实的模型提供商适配器。"

#: ../../learn/index.rst:125
msgid "Something unexpected? :doc:`troubleshooting` covers missing history, tool registration, endpoint compatibility, project guidance, and stuck approvals. If you need behavior the built-ins do not provide, follow :doc:`the extension tutorial <../extending/first-extension>`."
msgstr "遇到意外情况？:doc:`troubleshooting` 覆盖了历史记录缺失、工具注册、端点兼容性、项目指引和审批卡住等问题。如果需要内置功能没有提供的行为，请阅读 :doc:`扩展教程 <../extending/first-extension>`\\ 。"

